          q: 'What is the duty point of a centrifugal pump?',
          options: ['The flow printed on its nameplate by the pump maker', 'Where the pump curve and the system curve cross', 'The point on its curve with the highest head', 'The flow at which the pump starts to cavitate'],
          answer: 'Where the pump curve and the system curve cross',
          why: 'That is the only flow and head where what the pump delivers equals what the system needs.',
